1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:07,233
6:40 AM. Brightwall. The radio hums.
The blanket on my knees is still warm.
Two cups of tea are steaming on the
desk.

2
00:00:07,733 --> 00:00:13,600
There is nobody in the room. Nobody in
the street. A city of eleven thousand
people, and not one voice.

3
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:24,433
Four rules got me through the first
day alone. Three keep you alive. One
brings everybody back. I'll tell you
which at the very end.

4
00:00:24,933 --> 00:00:34,033
Last night we hung up on the dead
phone, and I fell asleep in the radio
chair. Rosa was right next to me. Mia
reads the 6:40 report every single
morning.
